# Allowlist: only the public repo output and app metadata are ever committed.
# fdroid/config.yml and fdroid/keystore.p12 hold the repo signing key and passwords.
*
!.gitignore
!.nojekyll
!README.md
!.github/
!.github/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!fdroid/
!fdroid/metadata/
!fdroid/metadata/**
!fdroid/repo/
!fdroid/repo/**
# Build logs: contain local paths and are not needed by clients.
fdroid/repo/status/
